  {
   "id": "1LZgqHT4FwAJ",
   "from": "Hugo Harada",
   "author": "73fb61795976b321",
   "date": "2018-09-19T02:03:09Z",
   "subject": "LAVAAN - Help with longitudinal measurements",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-size:small\"><div>Hello all,</div><div><br></div><div>I need some help with longitudinal measurements. I am trying to model latent trait of individuals using items, designed to measure the same trait but completely different items, at different moments. I am considering three different types of models as you can see in the attached figure. I would like to simultaneously estimate item and individual parameters and make sure that all are in the same scale. Measurements will be done months apart. Hopefully, I would like NOT to use common itens in the measurements.Is this possible?</div><div><br></div><div>My understanding is that</div><div><br></div><div>With Model 1, the scale of the items in moments 1 and 2 will <b>be different</b>. Is this correct?</div><div><br></div><div>With Model 2, the scale of the items in moments 1 and 2 will <b>be the same</b>. Is this correct?</div><div><br></div><div>With Model 3, the scale of the items in moments 1 and 2 will <b>be the same</b>. The assumption here is that the items will be equated with the linking test. Is this correct? If yes, how can  I pass these info to LAVAAN?</div><div><br></div>Any insight or references will help me greatly and will be highly welcome!<div><br></div><div>Looking forward to hearing from you,</div><div><br></div>Hugo</div><div><br></div>-- <br><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_signature\" data-smartmail=\"gmail_signature\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><br></div><div><br><table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:medium\"><tbody><tr><td align=\"left\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"10\"><p style=\"margin-right:10px;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:14px\"><a href=\"http://www.adaptativa.com.br/\" style=\"text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.adaptativa.com.br/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792424848448000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2e_xXL2QuPa-KUCwBlI5UE\"><img src=\"https://ci4.googleusercontent.com/proxy/FE2I4wjFnN2cAFKRmI3TKMszOlSp21wnNu4SqBeCJZBTRvT_FvrlgmwCaxvFTesKdXjysxxb7nvH4if6T_hi884vh3N59BHtgm3-wqx9bgkcnTo-Jw1Bg01c1Tk3qGCKYDUC3lEyIIXfgYCyCshNyEk3Ee8Wg4ibOcS9FfxhtyTI=s0-d-e1-ft#https://htmlsigs.s3.amazonaws.com/logos/files/000/177/391/landscape/adaptativa_256px80pxL_72dpi_SEM_SLOGAN.jpg\" alt=\"Adaptativa\" border=\"0\" height=\"62\" width=\"200\"></a></p></td><td align=\"left\"><p style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:14px;color:rgb(33,33,33)\"><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;display:inline\">Hugo Harada</span><span style=\"display:inline\"><br></span>Sócio-fundador - COO</font><span style=\"font-size:12px\"></span></p><p style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:14px\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;color:rgb(33,33,33);display:inline\">Adaptativa</span> <b>Inteligência Educacional S.A.</b><span style=\"display:inline\"><br></span><span style=\"color:rgb(33,33,33);display:inline\">Trab: (11) 3052-3117</span> / Cel: (11) 96345-0390<span style=\"display:inline\"><br></span><span style=\"color:rgb(33,33,33);display:inline\">Rua Claudio Soares, 72 - Sala 411</span><span style=\"display:block\"></span><span style=\"color:rgb(33,33,33);display:inline\">Pinheiros, CEP 05422-030, São Paulo - SP</span> <span style=\"display:inline\"><br></span><a href=\"http://www.adaptativa.com.br/\" style=\"color:rgb(71,124,204);text-decoration:none;display:inline\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.adaptativa.com.br/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792424848448000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2e_xXL2QuPa-KUCwBlI5UE\">http://www.adaptativa.com.br</a></p><p style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/Adaptativa\" style=\"text-decoration:none;display:inline\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.facebook.com/Adaptativa&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792424848448000&amp;usg=AOvVaw06s6Fmc25K_P--P23sh6DA\"><img width=\"32\" height=\"32\" src=\"https://ci5.googleusercontent.com/proxy/20HkiJQz7bLp3lgTxtMXxMbDVk07R90wNJAUHFnAXiz--9pafFlrbw_bwKf2nT1Q5nvK2DwlfAD8XasODsFVIdQFq4Gax7jc-pyBM5i6-g=s0-d-e1-ft#https://s3.amazonaws.com/htmlsig-assets/rounded/facebook.png\" alt=\"Facebook\" style=\"margin-bottom:5px;border:none;display:inline\"> </a><a href=\"https://twitter.com/_adaptativa_\" style=\"text-decoration:none;display:inline\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://twitter.com/_adaptativa_&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792424848448000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3pD1hlJqjqqaptsfVdeDkz\"><img width=\"32\" height=\"32\" src=\"https://ci5.googleusercontent.com/proxy/6mnatFZoDPos3ZGgupX3RNymdw8VQf1Ml9qZPfJQc8_e0g3AsncThjLRS8yceymEGACmj99cU3fHQdgAvneu2GQaYcZzCRtn6I9TA590=s0-d-e1-ft#https://s3.amazonaws.com/htmlsig-assets/rounded/twitter.png\" alt=\"Twitter\" style=\"margin-bottom:5px;border:none;display:inline\"> </a><a href=\"https://plus.google.com/+AdaptativaBr/posts\" style=\"text-decoration:none;display:inline\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://plus.google.com/%2BAdaptativaBr/posts&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792424848448000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0_c9yWHSyQU4gLpLwJuMgd\"><img width=\"32\" height=\"32\" src=\"https://ci4.googleusercontent.com/proxy/mhA_P_8E0pmuRnT1agE9wcSBWAE2DnO4LSA8T4HnXIKGoAhINpDb8uD8URx6EX9tPaMBl5EkXbAFsTBV-0VBqwx6Rdlg8Jrs69CkwXCbKS1W=s0-d-e1-ft#https://s3.amazonaws.com/htmlsig-assets/rounded/googleplus.png\" alt=\"Google Plus\" style=\"margin-bottom:5px;border:none;display:inline\"> </a><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/user/Adaptativa\" style=\"text-decoration:none;display:inline\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.youtube.com/user/Adaptativa&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792424848448000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1v2UUhhfrd4qFNe7ufBlRA\"><img width=\"32\" height=\"32\" src=\"https://ci5.googleusercontent.com/proxy/jyERAArzGOrJ5J6j2KqILf4cpSNChzTjlVyzQUkGsROeiabdFzcBrkCrC6IUxdNY1SZD45idUDPV8GflWCEfYff43HQx43GI2g19CZxt=s0-d-e1-ft#https://s3.amazonaws.com/htmlsig-assets/rounded/youtube.png\" alt=\"Youtube\" style=\"margin-bottom:5px;border:none;display:inline\"></a></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><p style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:14px\"></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>\r\n"
    ]
